              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ведущий (vedúshchiy) — \"a presenter, a host\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ведущий программы очень весёлый. Vedúshchiy prográmmy óchen vesyólyy. The presenter of the programme is very cheerful."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A participle of вести \"to lead\" used as a noun; a woman is ведущая. It declines like an adjective."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ведущий (vedúshchiy) is the present participle of вести \"to lead\" (EtymDB), an inherited Slavic verb from the same root as водить: the one who leads the show."
            }
          ]
        },
